--- !u!114 &263906187
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 263906184}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 94fc2fb0ec69f5b4aa31b608937185e6, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueTrigger
  dialogue:
    dialogueLines:
    - character:
        name: Dame Framboje
        icon: {fileID: 0}
      line: Hellooo there, and who might you be.
    - character:
        name: Player
        icon: {fileID: 0}
      line: 'Player name '
    - character:
        name: Dame Framboje
        icon: {fileID: 0}
      line: 'Nice to meet you, "name". Now aren''t you a handsome one. '
    - character:
        name: Dame Framboje
        icon: {fileID: 0}
      line: 'Cupcakes are sooo in season, wouldn''t you agree? '
    - character:
        name: Dame Framboje
        icon: {fileID: 0}
      line: 'Of course you would. That''s why you chose moi.  '
    - character:
        name: Dame Framboje
        icon: {fileID: 0}
      line: Now tell me monsieur "name", what's your favourite flavour?
    - character:
        name: Dame Framboje
        icon: {fileID: 0}
      line: 'VANILLA??? Oh, I didn''t know that you were so...tasteless. '
    - character:
        name: Dame Framboje
        icon: {fileID: 0}
      line: 'Oh, close enough...that''s my cousin. '
    - character:
        name: Dame Framboje
        icon: {fileID: 0}
      line: 'I knew you''d love Raspberries. Mmhhh, so you think I''m ravishing? '
    - character:
        name: Dame Framboje
        icon: {fileID: 0}
      line: 'Although disappointing, you are still better than that utterly stupid
        croissant. '
    - character:
        name: Dame Framboje
        icon: {fileID: 0}
      line: Oh, monsieur "name", you are soo much better that stupid croissant.
    - character:
        name: Dame Framboje
        icon: {fileID: 0}
      line: All butter and no brains.
    - character:
        name: Player
        icon: {fileID: 0}
      line: What happened?
    - character:
        name: Dame Framboje
        icon: {fileID: 0}
      line: So, do you see how strawberries and raspberries are cousins?
    - character:
        name: Dame Framboje
        icon: {fileID: 0}
      line: Well, let's just say that I found out the hard way that chocolate filled
        croissants prefer strawberries.
    - character:
        name: Player
        icon: {fileID: 0}
      line: 'How horrible. How can you bare to live beside him in that display. '
    - character:
        name: Dame Framboje
        icon: {fileID: 0}
      line: I despise it as much as I resent his existence
    - character:
        name: Dame Framboje
        icon: {fileID: 0}
      line: 'But you would never do that to me would you? '
    - character:
        name: Player
        icon: {fileID: 0}
      line: 'I would not dare. You are too beautiful to let go of. '
    - character:
        name: Dame Framboje
        icon: {fileID: 0}
      line: Mmmhhh, is that so?
    - character:
        name: Dame Framboje
        icon: {fileID: 0}
      line: As long as you will always choose me, then you may have all of me.
    - character:
        name: Player
        icon: {fileID: 0}
      line: I mean. There's always a better option.
    - character:
        name: Dame Framboje
        icon: {fileID: 0}
      line: A better option?
    - character:
        name: Dame Framboje
        icon: {fileID: 0}
      line: A...better. better. better...better option than me?
    - character:
        name: Dame Framboje
        icon: {fileID: 0}
      line: You've got to be kidding me.
    - character:
        name: Player
        icon: {fileID: 0}
      line: Oh, don't be like, I could still eat you. You know help you break free.
    - character:
        name: Dame Framboje
        icon: {fileID: 0}
      line: Ugh, whatever.
    - character:
        name: Player
        icon: {fileID: 0}
      line: Yeah, whatever, it's not like you're worth it anyways.
